1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,895
The night Flight 19 disappeared, the Navy sent a rescue plane with thirteen men aboard.

2
00:00:06,115 --> 00:00:07,166
It vanished too.

3
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:14,398
It took off at seven twenty seven, made one radio call three minutes later, and was never heard from again.

4
00:00:15,798 --> 00:00:21,726
At about nine fifteen, a tanker crew saw flames on the sea, burning for around ten minutes.

5
00:00:21,946 --> 00:00:25,636
A navy ship lost a plane from its radar at the same spot.

6
00:00:26,136 --> 00:00:28,807
Crews called those planes flying gas tanks.

7
00:00:29,027 --> 00:00:31,052
Their fuel lines were known to leak.

8
00:00:32,452 --> 00:00:33,220
One night.

9
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,463
Six aircraft.

10
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:35,786
Twenty seven men.

11
00:00:36,006 --> 00:00:38,533
The Bermuda Triangle legend started here.

12
00:00:39,033 --> 00:00:41,762
Follow for true stories history never finished.
